B.Gv=new A.eJ("Fizz and foam","Erupting Volcano","Baking soda meets vinegar and the lava foams over!",B.ZH,B.G4,B.IN,!1,B.fW,"Lava color",0,"Acid + Base","NaHCO\u2083 + CH\u2083COOH -> CH\u2083COONa + H\u2082O + CO\u2082","Vinegar is an acid and baking soda is a base. When they meet they make carbon dioxide, the same gas in fizzy drinks. The gas forms millions of tiny bubbles, and the dish soap traps them so the lava turns into thick foam.","Every piece in the equation has 1 of each part, so the numbers are all 1. The gas (CO\u2082) is what pushes the foam up and out.","Eruption! Carbon dioxide gas made the lava foam over.",4200,!1)
