B.Gu=new A.eJ("Mix and watch","Magic Milk","Drop in color, add soap and watch it swirl.",B.ZK,B.Ga,B.J7,!1,B.fX,"Drop color",4,"Surface tension",null,"Milk has tiny bits of fat floating in it. Dish soap pushes the surface of the milk around and chases after the fat, and the food coloring gets dragged along. That makes the swirls.","Soap is attracted to fat. It rushes through the milk and stirs everything up, so no equation is needed: the soap is moving things, not making something new.","Swirl! The soap chased the fat and the colors followed.",5000,!1)
